WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.112
Parts are made. Before they ship, quality signs them off.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.386
Open Quality.

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:10.837
Find your project, and hit Record final inspection.

00:00:11.437 --> 00:00:16.007
Type in what you measured. Out of tolerance? The ERP catches it right away.

00:00:16.357 --> 00:00:19.508
Let's enter the real reading. Now it's within the limits.

00:00:19.858 --> 00:00:22.669
Choose Pass, and say how many parts you measured.

00:00:25.008 --> 00:00:27.146
Save it, and the report is ready.

00:00:31.446 --> 00:00:34.190
Inspection passed. This order is good to go.

